{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "1578839938392a69f0fd5dda58a747f6fed00a9a5d8400fd991e4a58a72bf814", "ja": "接触─コンタクト─", "zh": "接触─接触─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "25cfbea0e86e9173230467e41b33d3cb64e65b44df487a94eee0da60b1a5e6c3", "ja": "記憶を取り戻したアンドロイド達は、ココロ\nをくれた恩人・チハヤに託された使命を果た\nすため、マザーAI・RITSUKO-9のオーダー\nを聞き、会場にいる人間達（お客さん達）と\nの接触を開始する。", "zh": "恢复了记忆的机器人们，为了完成赐予她们心灵的恩人·千早所托付的使命，听从母体AI·RITSUKO-9的指令，开始与会场中的人们（客人们）接触。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1000_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1de9edd147ef62d6970d51bae3a9cfd4024fc4457dc701ebd79114077cc2abb6", "ja": "再生、終了……。", "zh": "播放，结束……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "f11f01f2796f0c91a43a4cdcae514ae810fa1eddcad53c48c12e45472d776054", "ja": "……。思い出しました。\nあの人のこと、チハヤのこと……。", "zh": "……我想起来了。\n关于那个人，关于千早的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "d7e5e37178e1b5afcc24a343dc2aecb6f2b471ef24e225530e71cf03b8ceed22", "ja": "アンドロイドの私たちにココロをくれたこと、\nそして、そのココロを伝えること……。", "zh": "是那个人赋予了我们安卓之心，\n以及将这颗心传达出去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0de37018d0cad898c93a1372b48617ff2d617fedeb2622ffaa50f1857aced618", "ja": "はい。それがチハヤの願い……。\nそして、私たちの使命……。", "zh": "是的。那就是千早的愿望……\n也是我们的使命……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "8e1474417b20b8e6c5f78e4471747ce4cd8cbc59f30887110dc9a269064a4d2c", "ja": "私たちが再起動した理由はわからない。\nでも、やるべきことは、きっと……。", "zh": "我们为何重启，我还不清楚。\n但是，应该做的事，一定……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a816a747fbbd7043cd0c839ebf38266b44a8a94a8e6dc9733a76eaf0144c956c", "ja": "なるほど……もしかして、ここに\nたくさんの人間が集まっている理由は……。", "zh": "原来如此……难道说，人们纷纷聚集在这里的理由是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "147d8146c289a570906b4bb90b3ba1c8a39ee9080b57fc9c52b2da167621f1de", "ja": "ワアアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "7ab79e2ef7cc1af3d19d3dc8a0b082e792cbb30642a4909aab1369ea7dc8369d", "ja": "反応は、好意的と認識。アンドロイドに\n敵意のない人間たちのようね。", "zh": "反应判定为正面。看来你们是对安卓没有敌意的人类呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "18e6a6be5a219d635fc72dd1af712993b87154a5579f4b7af0abb315990a550f", "ja": "ここは慎重に接触を試みてみましょう。\n……みなさん、こんにちは。", "zh": "这里还是谨慎地尝试接触吧。\n……大家好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1009_audience", "source_sha256": "58b6c780b9ecc342948838ebe24dd3b25aadf8234598ff023bc5843d441f37bd", "ja": "こんにちはーーーー！！！！！", "zh": "你好————！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1010_audience", "source_sha256": "f5c37790b1994d71250db305f6948bb8bc3691a50b9276f08554cd2080acd1bc", "ja": "イベント、待ってたよーーーー！！！！！", "zh": "活动，我等你很久了————！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "463d2b78b682df025a37d0725a39d619a326f1ce16e8b85f36e7d64c1e82f14b", "ja": "すごい声援……。\n私たちの知っている人間とは、まるで違うわ。", "zh": "好热烈的加油声……  \n和我们所熟悉的人类简直截然不同。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cac08462eb193c322e26447f17a21d71593a9280097ca5b076530e8d432ca9c7", "ja": "はい。活力に満ち溢れていますね。\nまるで全員がチハヤのような……。", "zh": "是啊。真是充满活力呢。简直就像所有人都是千早一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "0c08641eb72bb5aa21b4e4b71c9c2dcec30412bcd65a6d8baaaec38cd52475aa", "ja": "もし、こんなにもたくさんの人間から、\nココロを知ることができたなら……。", "zh": "如果能从这么多的人身上，\n了解到心灵的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "adb3d6261a5ab937334cff7aaf21a08475123d8fb181d6718383ad86ed4e060f", "ja": "私たちのココロも、さらに成長するはず。", "zh": "我们的内心，也一定会进一步成长的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "123af527c225ff050689ee364cd7087e601f7767f2c385efc306b7b8cb3cb055", "ja": "ここはココロを伝える使命を持つ私たちに\n与えられた、夢のステージなのかもしれませんね。", "zh": "这里或许就是赋予我们这些肩负着传达心意使命之人的，梦想舞台吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "5d0b4f4e2f537199136dbec1b563469f89d0b5a2967283852da83d1fb5f29bf8", "ja": "なるほど。アンドロイドの見る夢、ですか……。\nしかし、具体的にどうすれば？", "zh": "原来如此。安卓看到的梦吗……。\n不过，具体该怎么做呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "a2dd3059456d5799acaeac542f50a2c03d211f971a7ed9018f165ebddbe19bc1", "ja": "それについてはオーダーがあるわ。\nRITSUKO-9から。", "zh": "关于这件事，我收到了一项指令。来自RITSUKO-9。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4db4b91d51cf7c6d64f04ea47cfa517b258234d7d88cae9923ac59646d8fbb9d", "ja": "！\nマザーAIから……？", "zh": "！来自母亲AI……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "f22674ddeb689b7bd9f4f0b85300d66d433154ed511aa4ce335c7b1053003421", "ja": "人間たちのいろいろな悩みに取り組んで、\nココロを学べって。", "zh": "要去面对人类各种各样的烦恼，学习人心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1020_051tmg", "source_sha256": "bab20eab15abf03b8d8f54cfaaca5958e96cc3bd192d25f034f05493c8718103", "ja": "なんだか、ずいぶん\n物分かりがよくなったような……。", "zh": "总觉得，好像变得特别善解人意了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "dcd00bbb73ec8641f57ac2d1d53eec388b9616c4be46649ee9fb59b11731a4a3", "ja": "なんといっても、夢のステージですから。\nそういうこともありえるかもしれません。", "zh": "毕竟，这是梦中的舞台。\n也许确实会发生这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "50c55aece3dd1c05e612d136137eb34ad2938ba6438a278d54a0b40ce5066e4a", "ja": "確かに。夢ならば、RITSUKO-9に変化が\nあっても、それほど不思議なことではありませんね。", "zh": "确实。既然是梦境，RITSUKO-9发生些变化，也不是什么奇怪的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "d3ef66b9de43b671bb95715b726ed2cbc39d87686d94ffc6a369085eb2218612", "ja": "悩みの数々は大勢の人間から集めたそうよ。\nもちろん、ここにいる人間たちも含めて。", "zh": "听说那些烦恼都是从许多人类那里收集来的。\n当然，也包括在场的各位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "d836eab68fbd68c2f9ad9b7f43ece0660506b4a360684368b1160f31aeb16cc6", "ja": "そうでしたか。人間のみなさん、私たちが\nココロを学ぶ様子を見守っていてください。", "zh": "原来如此。各位人类，请注视着我们学习“心”的过程。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1025_audience", "source_sha256": "147d8146c289a570906b4bb90b3ba1c8a39ee9080b57fc9c52b2da167621f1de", "ja": "ワアアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0294_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0294_story_02_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e251f3ab0a1a126bde77de3a1d0b93f88ef3dfad8ca2ca3259912debbacd173e", "ja": "力強い声……今からどんなココロが\n学べるのか、楽しみです。", "zh": "真是充满力量的声音……真期待接下来能学到怎样的心灵感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
